  "details": "Jivejdon from commit 5489372d through commit ee67a65e contains a reflected cross-site scripting vulnerability in application/query/taggedThreadList.jsp that allows unauthenticated attackers to inject script via unencoded tagID and count parameters. Attackers can craft a link with a script-closing payload in tagID or count, triggered when start exceeds zero, to execute JavaScript in victims' browsers.",
